    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu mwaka gw'okubanza ogw'omu busingye bwa Belishaza omugabe wa Babulooni, Danieli akaroota ekirooto, kandi yaayorekwa abyami aha kitanda kye. Bwanyima yaahandiika eki arootsire, yaakishoboorora omu bigambo bigufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kush 7:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Atyo yaagira ati: Ekiro kimwe nkoorekwa, naareeba emiyaga ena y'omu iguru neetabangura enyanja mpango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kush 13:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi omuri egyo nyanja haarugamu enyamaishwa mpango ina ezitarikushushana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ey'okubanza ekaba neeshusha entare kandi eine amapapa g'empungu. KU naabaire nkigihangire amaisho, amapapa gaayo gaakuurwa, yaimukibwa, yaayemerera n'ebigyere bibiri nk'omuntu, kandi yaaheebwa obwengye n'abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.2.39"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 2:39",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Naagaruka naareeba endiijo nyamaishwa ya kabiri, erikushusha edubu. Etunguukire orubaju rumwe, eine embaju eshatu omu maino; baagiragiira bati: Imuka, oshonshomere enyama nyingi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kush 13:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima y'ekyo naareeba endiijo nyamaishwa erikushusha engwe, eine amapapa g'empungu aha mugongo. Egyo nyamaishwa ekaba eine emitwe ena, kandi yaaheebwa obutegyeki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kush 11:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima y'ekyo naagaruka naareeba omu kworekwa kwa nyekiro enyamaishwa ya kana erikutiinisa, erikwitsa obwoba, kandi ey'amaani agatakareebwaga. Ekaba eine ebiino by'ebyoma, yaashonshomera ebintu, yaabihendagura, n'ebyatsigaraho yaabiteera emigyere. Ekaba eine omutaano n'enyamaishwa zoona ezaagibandiize; kandi eine amahembe ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kush 13:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku naabaire ninkyetegyereza ago mahembe, naareeba gaamerwamu erindi ihembe eryabaire riri rikye; amahembe ashatu omu g'okubanza gaakuuka n'emizi omu maisho gaaryo. Kandi reeba, omuri eryo ihembe rikye hakaba harimu amaisho garikushusha ag'omuntu, n'akanwa akarikugmba ebintu bikuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka nyowe, Danieli, omutima gwanyemerera, n'ebi nyorekirwe byantiinisa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nairira haihi omwe ahari abo abaabaire beemereire aho, naamubuuza amazima g'ebyo byona. Atyo yangambira, yanshobororera amakuru gaabyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "naagira ati: Ezo nyamaishwa mpango ina nibo bagabe bana, abariimuka omu nsi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.25.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 25:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.6.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 6:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.2.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kush 2:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.20.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.22.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka abarikwera ba Rukira-boona nibo bariheebwa obukama, bukaba obwabo okuhitsya ryari na ryari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima naayetenga kumanya amazima g'eby'enyamaishwa ya kana, eyaabaire eine omutaano n'ezindi zoona, neetiinisa munonga, ebiino byayo biri eby'ebyoma, n'ebyara byayo biri eby'emiringa, eyaashonshomeire ebintu ekabihendagura, kandi ebyatsigaireho ekabiteera omugyere; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi n'okumanya eby'ago mahembe ikumi agaabaire gari aha mutwe gwayo, n'eby'erindi ihembe eryamezire bwanyima, ashatu omuri gari gakakuurwa omu maisho gaaryo; n'eihembe eryabaire riine amaisho n'akanwa karikugamba ebintu bikuru, eryareebekire nirikira magyenzi gaaryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.11.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kush 11:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.13.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku naabaire ninkyetegyereza, eryo ihembe ryarwanisa abarikwera, ryaguma niribabinga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okuhitsya obu Ogwo Mukuru owa iranaira yaizire, abarikwera ba Rukira-boona bakasinga orubaja, obunaku bukahika, abarikwera bakaheebwa obukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
